{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Defias Tower in Westfall holds its Defias around and inside it (#9912, #9690)",
  "contract": "Issues #9912 and #9690 report the Westfall Defias Tower empty of Defias, with only Lenore the Hoarder (991515, guid 9950107) on its top floor. The archive (Exiles DB export 2026-09-13) and stock AzerothCore have no Defias Smuggler (95), Trapper (504) or Looter (590) within 60 yards of the tower, so the spawns were placed in game against Ascension footage: guids 9950700-9950729 in rev_20261103_00_coa_defias_tower_spawns.sql, outside on the ground and inside on the ground floor, stairs, middle, upper and top floors. Each must load at its placed position (0.5 yd) and stand on the ground or floor under it (spawn_placement grounded, 1 yd), Lenore must stay on the top floor, and the three sleeping Looters must load with stand state 3 (UNIT_STAND_STATE_SLEEP). The ground-floor crate stack, a second Hellfire Supplies 5 (97493, gameobject 9950315) like the one on the top floor, must load at its spot and rest on the floor. Positions are stored spawn positions; patrol movement, emotes, formation following and aggro lines are not measured here.",
  "timeout_ms": 90000,
